cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the MSSR method paper and this package."
type: software
title: "mssrscopR: Single-Frame Mean-Shift Super-Resolution Structure Maps"
version: 0.1.0.9003
authors:
  - family-names: Heller
    given-names: "R."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8006-9742"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CTTIR/mssrscopR"
url: "https://cttir.github.io/mssrscopR/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independent R implementation of single-frame Mean-Shift Super-Resolution
  (MSSR) with explicit geometry, defined behavior for degenerate input,
  structural masks for measuring original data, and a self-test against
  bundled synthetic fixtures.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Extending resolution within a single imaging frame"
    authors:
